	 ('baf64a7a-a240-44af-9204-828382ad4458'::uuid,'SPEED OF SOUND C','PARAMETER','{"{\"название\": \"SPEED OF SOUND C\", \"описание\": \"Speed at which sound travels through air, varies with altitude and atmospheric conditions\"}"}','Speed at which sound travels through air, varies with altitude and atmospheric conditions','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["22c3c2c423ad221ca214710cfa41f27d1e4dc8d6d2a92cf697c6e413557740e0d79914704f6f8c0e7f4ce8f21bf52fe6505883477ed45d7e212012e482c40ef5"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('900f4a0d-a965-48d5-a42d-245fd8e9ed67'::uuid,'ATTACHED FLOW','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"ATTACHED FLOW\", \"описание\": \"A type of laminar or transitional flow that forms on a solid surface in which gas does not separate \"}"}','A type of laminar or transitional flow that forms on a solid surface in which gas does not separate from it and maintains smooth interaction along its boundary layer.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["7bab4e0b9bf564415098605230a0b8c9801762a344b1305f6767edd6b3d9c9e7d69c62df8d4aa634a80ec96f8417c044943b33570af019c7be0aee94a675a2da", "7bab4e0b9bf564415098605230a0b8c9801762a344b1305f6767edd6b3d9c9e7d69c62df8d4aa634a80ec96f8417c044943b33570af019c7be0aee94a675a2da"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('3d79b839-f90f-4b63-a09e-434190402c0d'::uuid,'MOULTGOLFIER BROTHERS','ORGANIZATION','{}','First to achieve manned flight in 1783 with a hot-air balloon. Developed understanding of airflow and heavier-than-air craft.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["a5d4719b2541caf004e1082010054faa38c7ba80d90b5f7e39636fab5592ad3861a1d6acd00ebc78dac62d343df8f5398463149ba9cee12a0171444fbc1a02ad", "a5d4719b2541caf004e1082010054faa38c7ba80d90b5f7e39636fab5592ad3861a1d6acd00ebc78dac62d343df8f5398463149ba9cee12a0171444fbc1a02ad"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('2e6de6f5-da66-48d7-8932-a02737ec40f3'::uuid,'LEONARDO DA VINCI','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"LEONARDO DA VINCI\", \"описание\": \"Leonardo da Vinci was an influential historical figure renowned for his groundbreaking observations \"}"}','Leonardo da Vinci was an influential historical figure renowned for his groundbreaking observations and concepts across various disciplines, particularly within the realm of fluid dynamics. His insights into hydrodynamics were pioneering, as he made significant theoretical contributions that anticipated modern understanding in this field. Although some of his designs related to fluid dynamics may not have been physically realized during his time, they nevertheless showcased his forward-thinking vision.

Da Vinci also played a crucial role in the conceptualization of human flight, an area where his innovative ideas were ahead of their time. He conceived multiple projects and drafted detailed sketches intended to facilitate human flight, even though he did not see these designs through into practical implementations. It was only later centuries that engineers and scientists would build on his theoretical work to bring some of these concepts to fruition. Thus, while da Vinci may not have ','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "2e9ab909fa00e8633f612e2ff91a1104e10bcb90497c34e3402b71ef3457891e98b8a02caae3e6e229aac92c0c890dbd32b2f49dd7eb38da47a97c5e1a2a24ca"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('1410ae5e-19ab-4c60-a853-5c50458aca4a'::uuid,'HANG GLIDER','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"HANG GLIDER\", \"описание\": \"Hang glider refers to an early design for an aircraft characterized by its rigid wing without tradit\"}"}','Hang glider refers to an early design for an aircraft characterized by its rigid wing without traditional empennage or other control surfaces, similar to bird wings as depicted in Leonardo da Vinci''s visionary designs. Historically, this device was a subject of interest among aviation pioneers such as Otto Lilienthal and John S. W. H. Pilcher. These early gliders utilized human lifting as the primary means for controlling the aircraft’s maneuvers, although this method posed significant challenges. Notably, both Lilienthal and Pilcher encountered difficulties with loss of control during unsteady winds, underscoring the technical complexities involved in early flight experiments.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 5, "text_unit_ids": ["e9e299fdd315262c60dc335f6516a7d09106b9d9354cb34f01b7599af64f2d9273530938403a9f1b91129f2a67f0cccb25885ad1cf8e1ad0f9c71aea12340520", "e9e299fdd315262c60dc335f6516a7d09106b9d9354cb34f01b7599af64f2d9273530938403a9f1b91129f2a67f0cccb25885ad1cf8e1ad0f9c71aea12340520", "71513cc51ffa1e8b185f20e95d505c81a39cad56f6db7e0192988badc6a212324cd2dca2a6e0b895668f6133ccf33ae88b3164f544f6ed7f319db021e5f84305", "46b667214423448900a64449a21a8d78137e40dbbcde1ff7361b13892626a596937541e8a1dff8c28756c1af322bcfde1298239045005d93a04cd46043247c20", "ccac1a178375331bc449ac2d2eec635f0983c00e6d254912345c012c0c41f3a9cc65da465cf715f8bc206801bb7f81cd82c005354ce5454c3970c507c2045930"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('3defade9-8828-4c34-bd18-8c5c21e79b74'::uuid,'RELAXED STATIC STABILITY (RSS) AIRCRAFT','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"RELAXED STATIC STABILITY (RSS) AIRCRAFT\", \"описание\": \"Aircraft introduced in the 1970s that differ from earlier designs like Cayley''s configuration\"}"}','Aircraft introduced in the 1970s that differ from earlier designs like Cayley''s configuration','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["fbfbe3eab64670ade81f0f5bb091f801c41f6144a0b8e541a66dad3c1f397496968ec6594738a46e5d6eca8ef00ae4a984c6e2a885277c5555498e6becc7e9c6"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('d106d137-8926-4836-a162-c11f0d2630f1'::uuid,'EXTERNAL AERODYNAMICS','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"EXTERNAL AERODYNAMICS\", \"описание\": \"Involves flows over bodies that are much smaller in size compared to the dimensions of their surroun\"}"}','Involves flows over bodies that are much smaller in size compared to the dimensions of their surroundings, such as airplanes or aircraft moving through open space with minimal flow obstruction by channels.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["7bab4e0b9bf564415098605230a0b8c9801762a344b1305f6767edd6b3d9c9e7d69c62df8d4aa634a80ec96f8417c044943b33570af019c7be0aee94a675a2da", "7bab4e0b9bf564415098605230a0b8c9801762a344b1305f6767edd6b3d9c9e7d69c62df8d4aa634a80ec96f8417c044943b33570af019c7be0aee94a675a2da"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('d81f05c8-4869-4c9e-9385-3d79f6ef483e'::uuid,'TORQUE_MZ','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"TORQUE_MZ\", \"описание\": \"Torque component Mz is an internal force causing rotational action around the Z axis, as per the for\"}"}','Torque component Mz is an internal force causing rotational action around the Z axis, as per the force decomposition into moments','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["aea6c651ec0fecfc47e79f37f7a830a1f5a1d8931712fbbf248dce3638450697754592ecf22476fe4edc6597c8adadaaa0a8594141780b5e85c35377ad4d489c"]}','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','sopromat_v1');

Unfortunately, Pilcher faced one such challenge himself. While attempting a hang gliding flight under difficult weather conditions, he lost control and was fatally injured in an accident. This tragic event highlights the inherent risks associated with being among the first to explore and push the boundaries of human flight through lighter-than-air technologies. Despite his untimely death, Pilcher''s contributions to early aviation—especially his collaborative efforts with Lilienthal—have left a lasting l','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["71513cc51ffa1e8b185f20e95d505c81a39cad56f6db7e0192988badc6a212324cd2dca2a6e0b895668f6133ccf33ae88b3164f544f6ed7f319db021e5f84305", "f5cd08a5bba8e5f1cac73b2168b03f440d049e82b880cf5ff9b03a61f932ab149f55ecbff1e2e45fc298cd176b96304c704c6f0d04ce87977c3be47e617c941b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('d2b80229-2cb6-4dfd-aeba-4c29e057bd7f'::uuid,'CHANUTE','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"CHANUTE\", \"описание\": \"William Joseph \\\"Billy\\\" Chanute made significant contributions to the field of aerodynamics through h\"}"}','William Joseph "Billy" Chanute made significant contributions to the field of aerodynamics through his support for pioneering aviators. While Chanute himself did not serve as an aviator, he actively contributed to early aviation research by providing financial backing and encouragement to notable figures such as Otto Lilienthal, who was a leading figure in glider research during the late 19th century. Additionally, Chanute''s support extended beyond Lilienthal; he also collaborated with other prominent individuals involved in aviation research at the turn of the century. Notably, records indicate his work overlapped with that of the Wright brothers, aligning with their efforts to advance aerodynamic principles and aircraft design. Through his dedicated financial assistance and intellectual engagement, Chanute played a crucial role in fostering an environment conducive to the development of aviation technology, thereby making him a pivotal figure in early 20th-century aeronautical resear','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["71513cc51ffa1e8b185f20e95d505c81a39cad56f6db7e0192988badc6a212324cd2dca2a6e0b895668f6133ccf33ae88b3164f544f6ed7f319db021e5f84305", "5b2cda8d5bbd5d82e2c6fdbd3f95d22ccf5c61786e126e8b0c5e7391999cff6606a62534e3cc3ff179c861f6e0cb19ee489f79b583fb0cfba038d14349b9403b", "5b2cda8d5bbd5d82e2c6fdbd3f95d22ccf5c61786e126e8b0c5e7391999cff6606a62534e3cc3ff179c861f6e0cb19ee489f79b583fb0cfba038d14349b9403b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('0ff30a45-c20f-4829-b1bc-fb3fc79e3ff7'::uuid,'WING_TAPER','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"WING_TAPER\", \"описание\": \"A design characteristic that varies the width or thickness of a wing along its length, crucial for o\"}"}','A design characteristic that varies the width or thickness of a wing along its length, crucial for optimizing aerodynamic performance but poorly understood at the time.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["71513cc51ffa1e8b185f20e95d505c81a39cad56f6db7e0192988badc6a212324cd2dca2a6e0b895668f6133ccf33ae88b3164f544f6ed7f319db021e5f84305"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('7c3082e0-864c-43ae-a2c3-4318f96962dd'::uuid,'WHIRLING ARMS','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"WHIRLING ARMS\", \"описание\": \"\\\"Whirling Arms,\\\" a device utilized in both fluid mechanics and aerodynamics studies, consists of a s\"}"}','"Whirling Arms," a device utilized in both fluid mechanics and aerodynamics studies, consists of a spinning arm equipped with a model. This apparatus serves multiple critical functions in experimental setups. Primarily, whirling arms are essential tools for calibrating hot wire anemometry to ensure accurate measurements of velocity fields within the spinning model''s wake. Additionally, they play a vital role in investigating dynamic models and measuring stability derivatives, providing valuable data on aerodynamic performance under various conditions. The comprehensive nature of these devices makes them indispensable for researchers and engineers seeking detailed insights into fluid dynamics and aerodynamic behaviors through controlled experiments.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "653aa46087e791b134dbbd802cc7f2be070fd13ba9b27acc8585793069a21cb0efa3b5f8653b3d05323cc3ed759a463b78204a2bc4749488e28d38de3050a9cc"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('2ceb38ce-aeba-4805-ac02-2151f607f1fc'::uuid,'SIR GEORGE GABRIEL STOKES'' CONTRIBUTIONS','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"SIR GEORGE GABRIEL STOKES'' CONTRIBUTIONS\", \"описание\": \"Studied turbulent flows and expanded the mathematical foundations of fluid dynamics significantly du\"}"}','Studied turbulent flows and expanded the mathematical foundations of fluid dynamics significantly during 19th century.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["9e10720d8940a92e4cb58f1bbba8fe75c8a91e85474223b792dbc80444a1fa4dbf9183cca9e48a6d7ad55762d1099a1f77e0c2f98fb57732b6605de4fdcda42c"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('02f2ab0f-d784-4a98-bb4d-dded7f79fa74'::uuid,'CONTINUITY EQUATION','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"CONTINUITY EQUATION\", \"описание\": \"The CONTINUITY EQUATION is a fundamental mathematical formulation that expresses the principle of co\"}"}','The CONTINUITY EQUATION is a fundamental mathematical formulation that expresses the principle of conservation of mass in fluid and gas flows. This equation specifically describes how mass is conserved within a streamtube, which is an imaginary tubular control volume through which fluids or gases flow continuously without separation. The general form of this equation can be represented as ρ₁ V₁ F₁ = ρ₂ V₂ F₂, where:

- ρ₁ and ρ₂ represent the densities of the fluid at two different points in the streamtube.
- V₁ and V₂ denote the velocities of the fluid at these respective points.
- F₁ and F₂ are cross-sectional areas at the two points.

This equation illustrates that the product of density, velocity, and area must remain constant along a streamline under steady-state conditions, assuming no mass is created or destroyed within the system. Thus, as fluid passes through different sections of the streamtube with varying velocities and densities, its flow adjusts to maintain this balance, ','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["3f5f80cfe6f81afa1ad15ce51cf5ac93a304c821fd4dbd8b07af07ffa13187309e13e76867919c83410e3fcf45602d1325632639560245e5c33c5c327415cc53", "b5612dfd5afd1a966867270904e7977f694cbe6e96b4be34a53c32ab6f48a581ba2e0825a6d9165aaeb6957d598461f699ff9ff6c7b4ff82bb2c2e2dba4929d9", "b5612dfd5afd1a966867270904e7977f694cbe6e96b4be34a53c32ab6f48a581ba2e0825a6d9165aaeb6957d598461f699ff9ff6c7b4ff82bb2c2e2dba4929d9"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('bc92b6bf-7a8c-4ee3-b38e-bf88503ef86e'::uuid,'ENERGY CONSERVATION LAW','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"ENERGY CONSERVATION LAW\", \"описание\": \"Conservation law related to the movement and transformation of energy within a system, essential for\"}"}','Conservation law related to the movement and transformation of energy within a system, essential for studying fluid dynamics','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["3f5f80cfe6f81afa1ad15ce51cf5ac93a304c821fd4dbd8b07af07ffa13187309e13e76867919c83410e3fcf45602d1325632639560245e5c33c5c327415cc53"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('9e38227e-1a88-4deb-8004-41338e733b26'::uuid,'REYNOLDS NUMBER RELATIONSHIP','BOUNDARY LAYER','{}','Reynolds number relationship with boundary layer behavior. Higher Reynolds numbers indicate more turbulent flow; thus, understanding boundary layer changes along with Reynolds numbers helps predict turbulence onset}.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["5985fc6749a64fb8e61f7a2dcaeb6777591d07e107e27e9f81ec141746d44adcac5a3c9000993f0f170c0b6328ef2350e35bc72f717da15ff3420d8f6ff42f91"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('a9812dcb-b0e7-44a1-b195-946e42edcb8e'::uuid,'HOT AIR BALLOONS34','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"HOT AIR BALLOONS34\", \"описание\": \"Hot air balloons utilized for lifting purposes in China around the 3rd century BC, based on thermal \"}"}','Hot air balloons utilized for lifting purposes in China around the 3rd century BC, based on thermal heating and air displacement','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["d54c07ac8327b71b66713db09c704c4ad7a27589908a44f20e1f82f6862ae8906f07bdd5f724a455c02b8ccd11318bb80dcc8b5fca7721aaa202a67c6b5b51bb"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics');

