	 ('51f46b76-2bc7-49a1-8f11-7543ad5b6532'::uuid,'FORCE OF INTERACTION BETWEEN FLUID AND BODY','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"FORCE OF INTERACTION BETWEEN FLUID AND BODY\", \"описание\": \"Describes how a fluid affects different bodies in motion within it or those bodies affect the fluid \"}"}','Describes how a fluid affects different bodies in motion within it or those bodies affect the fluid flow directly.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["f20c8fea18ca81aea3e162ebb165623222ecb4d9dee868b802418aa04d280ec7571ef024191fee26981dc11fddc231e846a5ecff704645d44d2493b5ebd1eec7", "f20c8fea18ca81aea3e162ebb165623222ecb4d9dee868b802418aa04d280ec7571ef024191fee26981dc11fddc231e846a5ecff704645d44d2493b5ebd1eec7"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('3a1d582e-4b18-41d8-9829-1d38f38594f7'::uuid,'TIME_DEPENDENCE','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"TIME_DEPENDENCE\", \"описание\": \"The time-varying nature of particle coordinates in the velocity vector V, indicating how position ch\"}"}','The time-varying nature of particle coordinates in the velocity vector V, indicating how position changes over time.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["f6c3b3b269e7af478487328e5313e02a8c137117cbe55dacc0858717330e7e05c2ae5032253aaf5d9ddafd9ecef1939f5b0aaf00ae9bd44a279c22bd1b4c6c20"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('ebec2cd5-81ff-4925-8e83-39e39bb7803b'::uuid,'\(\TEXT{UNDERCOOLING OF THE MELT}\)','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"\\\\(\\\\TEXT{UNDERCOOLING OF THE MELT}\\\\)\", \"описание\": \"Decreases critical radius and increases crystallisation centre formation, resulting in smaller grain\"}"}','Decreases critical radius and increases crystallisation centre formation, resulting in smaller grains for nanocrystalline solids','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["7240ecd7cd3c1f2f5946a1bf025a209f608b3d37b39114678d0dcb4b7ce8fee876f7ed03a080fadc4ba98785695ba4eb87b734cf4ddef1493fd19dc6a2f49a0e"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1'),
	 ('5c2c0117-ec95-4bf5-9f48-a3e0d8c7164e'::uuid,'LIQUID STATE','STATE','{"{\"название\": \"LIQUID STATE\", \"описание\": \"The Liquid State is a phase characterized by the dynamic behavior of its constituent atoms or molecu\"}"}','The Liquid State is a phase characterized by the dynamic behavior of its constituent atoms or molecules. In this state, particles exhibit chaotic movements and undergo random positional changes due to relatively low intermolecular forces compared to those in solid states. A key feature of the liquid state is its ability to transition to the solid state through a process known as crystallization, where ordered structures form due to stronger attractive forces overcoming the disordered movement of particles. This transformation signifies a reduction in thermal energy, leading to decreased molecular motion and closer packing of constituent units.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["d6d7f1e636dd37d1d486e1147e50bb55a86e562c7aa76fe7db2fd92b8edc1a5763f08ccea27e0cdfab16c1e418d6907a556395f5d666eb5ad38e350bb4fe96fa", "d6d7f1e636dd37d1d486e1147e50bb55a86e562c7aa76fe7db2fd92b8edc1a5763f08ccea27e0cdfab16c1e418d6907a556395f5d666eb5ad38e350bb4fe96fa"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1'),
	 ('036fc9f6-c573-4eeb-b600-6e5b1a154491'::uuid,'ANISOTROPY','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"ANISOTROPY\", \"описание\": \"ANISOTROPY is a condition characterized by varying elasticity characteristics in materials based on \"}"}','ANISOTROPY is a condition characterized by varying elasticity characteristics in materials based on their orientation, differentiating it from isotropy which lacks such directional dependence. This property highlights how mechanical properties can differ significantly depending on the direction in which forces are applied to anisotropic materials, making them distinct from isotropic ones where properties are uniform in all directions.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["11c9a21d6a0a9c5abe6f306c213575c0e955cd0c882c3149ea3e9f2422eeedd68b3e55978e3b0c3e8c74dc92b4bcf8a8e937a6aefe488e4d795bda2147b07272", "11c9a21d6a0a9c5abe6f306c213575c0e955cd0c882c3149ea3e9f2422eeedd68b3e55978e3b0c3e8c74dc92b4bcf8a8e937a6aefe488e4d795bda2147b07272"]}','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','sopromat_v1'),
