	 ('1622eb13-622b-439e-ad08-9f1256a6d762'::uuid,'WRIGHT BROTHERS','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"WRIGHT BROTHERS\", \"описание\": \"Wright Brothers, consisting of Orville and Wilbur Wright, were American pioneers instrumental in the\"}"}','Wright Brothers, consisting of Orville and Wilbur Wright, were American pioneers instrumental in the development and successful flight of the world’s first self-propelled, fully controllable airplane. They devoted significant effort to early aircraft design and succeeded in achieving sustained and controlled flight, marking a pivotal moment in aviation history. Their achievements surpassed those of other contemporary researchers such as Langley, who had also been conducting related experiments. The Wright brothers’ innovation and determination solidified their place as key figures in the origins of powered air travel.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "baaa62fd839985ce0a3d03b2d98ddcadb6f3444480414cdd20d36ee69e47687c9474cf34e27996edfbc0ef5e505f086b7089d7dffa034ef135e1881d1386aee9"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics');

