	 ('b19973ad-57df-421b-9b9b-8dafdee2ac0c'::uuid,'PERCY PILCHER','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"PERCY PILCHER\", \"описание\": \"English aviation pioneer who continued Lilienthal''s gliding work and tragically died in a crash sim\"}"}','English aviation pioneer who continued Lilienthal''s gliding work and tragically died in a crash similar to Lilienthal’s','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["ee745461b2211d842e88d29f225a86ba7063e293122d56b41cea0528892369a6d28a8de8ecaaba49f767d0dc0952376d919da861f26599624546ddc82d9781c5"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('d9e2ae2c-f3fb-4156-96d7-a8f7f64c73f9'::uuid,'OCTAVE CHANUTE','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"OCTAVE CHANUTE\", \"описание\": \"Octave Chanute was an American civil engineer who played a significant role in early aviation develo\"}"}','Octave Chanute was an American civil engineer who played a significant role in early aviation developments. He funded and supported the construction of several glider designs, particularly focusing on biplane structures inspired by Otto Lilienthal''s work. Chanute’s contributions extended beyond financial support; he also collaborated closely with pioneering aviators such as the Wright brothers, introducing them to advanced flight design principles including the innovative Pratt truss. This collaboration between Chanute and the Wrights facilitated mutual learning and advancements in heavier-than-air aircraft technology. Through his efforts, Chanute helped bridge earlier research from Lilienthal with more refined structural designs, significantly influencing early aviation development.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["ee745461b2211d842e88d29f225a86ba7063e293122d56b41cea0528892369a6d28a8de8ecaaba49f767d0dc0952376d919da861f26599624546ddc82d9781c5", "a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e", "ccac1a178375331bc449ac2d2eec635f0983c00e6d254912345c012c0c41f3a9cc65da465cf715f8bc206801bb7f81cd82c005354ce5454c3970c507c2045930"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('339c34fc-6586-4968-a081-b0ea669510a0'::uuid,'BLADDERS FILLED WITH AIR (BY EIFFEL)','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"BLADDERS FILLED WITH AIR (BY EIFFEL)\", \"описание\": \"The entity \\\"BLADDERS FILLED WITH AIR (BY EIFFEL)\\\" refers to components designed and tested by Gustav\"}"}','The entity "BLADDERS FILLED WITH AIR (BY EIFFEL)" refers to components designed and tested by Gustave Eiffel for use during high-altitude drag measurements. These bladders, filled with air, were integral parts of Eiffel''s experimental setup conducted in his 1902 investigations. The primary purpose of these devices was to measure the air resistance experienced by objects at high altitudes. Eiffel’s experiments aimed to gather crucial data that could be valuable for various engineering applications, especially those related to aerodynamics and flight dynamics. Through rigorous design and testing processes, Eiffel ensured the reliability and effectiveness of these bladders in providing accurate measurement results during his pioneering research.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["8e8b5bf24dddb1ddb50b7cbf2d3c92c98694db8e547ae1917342574e7e171cb95e09a476096026b49868f4048da326a354b623333e0ac1b3a5e0a358ea00009f", "8e8b5bf24dddb1ddb50b7cbf2d3c92c98694db8e547ae1917342574e7e171cb95e09a476096026b49868f4048da326a354b623333e0ac1b3a5e0a358ea00009f"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('0bad6fd2-54d9-448a-8fb5-ab620b152270'::uuid,'DRAG COEFFICIENT','PROPERTY','{"{\"название\": \"DRAG COEFFICIENT\", \"описание\": \"(Measure of the drag force on an object relative to its size, velocity, and the fluid through which \"}"}','(Measure of the drag force on an object relative to its size, velocity, and the fluid through which it is moving; a key factor in the resistance mechanism','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["8e8b5bf24dddb1ddb50b7cbf2d3c92c98694db8e547ae1917342574e7e171cb95e09a476096026b49868f4048da326a354b623333e0ac1b3a5e0a358ea00009f"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics');

After the conclusion of World War I, there was a notable shift in the use and collaboration between these wind tunnel research centers. Germany and its influential contributions, especially through the work of Ludwig Prandtl and his pioneering tunnels, played a critical role. The post-WWI period witnessed an increasing reliance on German equipment by researchers from France, Britain, Italy, and America. Notably, figures like Max Munk contributed to this transfer of knowledge and technology, moving abroad to continue research in other countries that adopted the German methodologies.

This transition facilitated a cross-pollination of ideas and practical ap','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["75e55aae79fa4fef8afa00e4bf79f6f1f694d27b10f227c1f393bd8cf61700080ce3c057271ae7311d2d3cd09b4445ff1281543e67c2ce7840a138c9f1467077", "75e55aae79fa4fef8afa00e4bf79f6f1f694d27b10f227c1f393bd8cf61700080ce3c057271ae7311d2d3cd09b4445ff1281543e67c2ce7840a138c9f1467077"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('2eb7196d-51e0-4348-a58f-817a38ce6d30'::uuid,'WIND TUNNEL','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"WIND TUNNEL\", \"описание\": \"The Wind Tunnel is an essential tool developed primarily for experimental testing purposes. Initiall\"}"}','The Wind Tunnel is an essential tool developed primarily for experimental testing purposes. Initially conceptualized in the 19th century, wind tunnels played a pivotal role in advancing aviation technology by facilitating detailed observations necessary for refining aircraft designs. Named after its pioneer, Maxim, this apparatus was crucial in understanding and analyzing the behavior of air around various shapes, including wings and bodies. It significantly aided early aviation pioneers such as Lilienthal, contributing to their design innovations. By enabling detailed aerodynamic tests, wind tunnels revolutionized the approach to aircraft development, ensuring that designs could be scientifically validated before full-scale production. This tool was indispensable in the refinement of airfoils and overall aircraft stability, making it a critical component for early and subsequent advancements in aviation technology.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 6, "text_unit_ids": ["29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c", "4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c", "4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c", "ee745461b2211d842e88d29f225a86ba7063e293122d56b41cea0528892369a6d28a8de8ecaaba49f767d0dc0952376d919da861f26599624546ddc82d9781c5"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('f5561022-df38-4c31-b827-95fb6fc9a11e'::uuid,'WIND TUNNELS','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"WIND TUNNELS\", \"описание\": \"Wind tunnels are systems designed to test various models under controlled airflow conditions. These \"}"}','Wind tunnels are systems designed to test various models under controlled airflow conditions. These devices are crucial for aerospace engineering and related fields, allowing researchers to study the behavior of model aircraft in a consistent flow of air. While wind tunnel technology was beyond the scope of early pioneers like Leonardo da Vinci, these facilities have evolved significantly over time to provide more precise and reliable testing environments. Modern wind tunnels are characterized by their ability to generate uniform, low-turbulence airflow, making them indispensable tools for contemporary aerodynamic research. Notable improvements in design have enhanced accuracy and efficiency, although early versions often lacked the sophistication seen in today''s advanced systems.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 6, "text_unit_ids": ["e9e299fdd315262c60dc335f6516a7d09106b9d9354cb34f01b7599af64f2d9273530938403a9f1b91129f2a67f0cccb25885ad1cf8e1ad0f9c71aea12340520", "e9e299fdd315262c60dc335f6516a7d09106b9d9354cb34f01b7599af64f2d9273530938403a9f1b91129f2a67f0cccb25885ad1cf8e1ad0f9c71aea12340520", "98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "653aa46087e791b134dbbd802cc7f2be070fd13ba9b27acc8585793069a21cb0efa3b5f8653b3d05323cc3ed759a463b78204a2bc4749488e28d38de3050a9cc", "653aa46087e791b134dbbd802cc7f2be070fd13ba9b27acc8585793069a21cb0efa3b5f8653b3d05323cc3ed759a463b78204a2bc4749488e28d38de3050a9cc"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('4d897274-a5db-4771-b531-9b80d9decf91'::uuid,'LILIENTHAL','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"LILIENTHAL\", \"описание\": \"Otto Lilienthal, often referred to simply as LILIENTHAL, was a pioneering figure in the field of aer\"}"}','Otto Lilienthal, often referred to simply as LILIENTHAL, was a pioneering figure in the field of aeronautics, known for his significant work in glider development. His research and experiments laid foundational groundwork that advanced the understanding of air resistance, lift mechanisms, and ultimately contributed to the progress of both hang gliding and powered flight. Noted for numerous glider flights in the late 19th century, Lilienthal''s contributions have been instrumental in aeronautical engineering. Through meticulous observation and practical experimentation, he refined our comprehension of aerodynamics, making him a key figure in the early stages of aviation history. His work not only propelled the development of gliders but also facilitated critical insights that would later support the invention of more advanced aircraft. As an early aviation pioneer, Lilienthal''s legacy endures through his ongoing influence on the principles and practices central to modern flying technique','{}','{}','{"frequency": 5, "text_unit_ids": ["71513cc51ffa1e8b185f20e95d505c81a39cad56f6db7e0192988badc6a212324cd2dca2a6e0b895668f6133ccf33ae88b3164f544f6ed7f319db021e5f84305", "5b2cda8d5bbd5d82e2c6fdbd3f95d22ccf5c61786e126e8b0c5e7391999cff6606a62534e3cc3ff179c861f6e0cb19ee489f79b583fb0cfba038d14349b9403b", "5b2cda8d5bbd5d82e2c6fdbd3f95d22ccf5c61786e126e8b0c5e7391999cff6606a62534e3cc3ff179c861f6e0cb19ee489f79b583fb0cfba038d14349b9403b", "61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39", "61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
