	 ('d651845c-af5d-4a0e-8224-08582a8ed9b3'::uuid,'WENHAM''S DEVICE','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"WENHAM''S DEVICE\", \"описание\": \"WENHAM''S DEVICE refers to a square-section wind tunnel that played a significant role in early aero\"}"}','WENHAM''S DEVICE refers to a square-section wind tunnel that played a significant role in early aerodynamic research, particularly focusing on drag measurements and other similar applications. This device served as the foundational equipment from which later designs were differentiated by their shape, though they maintained similarities in purpose and functionality. Specifically, Wenham''s device was instrumental for measuring the drag of projectiles and other objects, aligning with broader efforts at understanding air resistance during the late 19th and early 20th centuries. The design of Wenham’s square-section wind tunnel marked a pivotal step in the development of aerodynamic testing techniques, serving as the standard against which subsequent, possibly more refined or differently shaped wind tunnels were compared.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["6cfb4419f8267d18f97a1bf9437f18c2fff2b46c4b4880ad7918290d562f0899526da9fb0c4b926965ffc8ef15460d197a1dd9b00d1923f6635f3ef8fdec8eaa", "6cfb4419f8267d18f97a1bf9437f18c2fff2b46c4b4880ad7918290d562f0899526da9fb0c4b926965ffc8ef15460d197a1dd9b00d1923f6635f3ef8fdec8eaa", "6cfb4419f8267d18f97a1bf9437f18c2fff2b46c4b4880ad7918290d562f0899526da9fb0c4b926965ffc8ef15460d197a1dd9b00d1923f6635f3ef8fdec8eaa"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('db251fc9-1398-4406-807a-d83ba16eca3a'::uuid,'FAN','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"FAN\", \"описание\": \"The entity \\\"FAN\\\" refers to the critical fan components utilized in the tunnel systems, particularly \"}"}','The entity "FAN" refers to the critical fan components utilized in the tunnel systems, particularly within Kernot78’s tunnel. These fans play a vital role in managing airflow and ensuring optimal performance within the tunnels. Additionally, it is noted that the fan component of Kernot78''s tunnel is driven by a gas engine. This setup underscores the importance of robust ventilation systems for efficient operation and safety.

These comprehensive fan components are essential for maintaining consistent airflow throughout both tunnels, contributing to their operational effectiveness. The use of a gas engine驱动的风扇组件在Kernot78隧道中的应用进一步强调了这些组件的重要性，并为隧道系统的高效运行和安全性提供了坚实保障。','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["9b04b65904320d152e1a24cfa860cad23a1e8cf8a6b3402f1434285bed985ebbf31d5bfe08c052a7e873eb3dccd9ad3800832d2194ca94adad02b5f4b8043f99", "af0b7dc953d20f99423204bc6976714fb8bc794b04cf5ce8101cfceef20985a957bc6eca2691ec075aaa01420b302e2b2b0c8d5a5c0d508a6dabb65c91d84d5a"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
