	 ('987a532c-638f-4a41-8f71-780aaa9fca7b'::uuid,'AIRSHIP','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"AIRSHIP\", \"описание\": \"The entity \\\"AIRSHIP\\\" refers to a powered heavier-than-air craft, which evolved significantly during \"}"}','The entity "AIRSHIP" refers to a powered heavier-than-air craft, which evolved significantly during the technological advancements of the 1800s. Early forms of airships were described by inventors such as Giffard and Forlanini. These early airships were steerable and featured powered propulsion, setting the stage for the development of later dirigibles. The term encompasses a progression from the initial concept to more sophisticated designs that combined steerability with powered flight, marking a pivotal era in the history of aviation technology.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 5, "text_unit_ids": ["624b0f2e5156161ffdb09c558f32b39ad0bf347e1dcc51d0cc803eb1592f75125b51005c9a82dfcfa9afb96df74b8311d90272937604af08308a19e41b14f3c5", "624b0f2e5156161ffdb09c558f32b39ad0bf347e1dcc51d0cc803eb1592f75125b51005c9a82dfcfa9afb96df74b8311d90272937604af08308a19e41b14f3c5", "624b0f2e5156161ffdb09c558f32b39ad0bf347e1dcc51d0cc803eb1592f75125b51005c9a82dfcfa9afb96df74b8311d90272937604af08308a19e41b14f3c5", "b93603f69bb902d6bc4a15e32e34bac0942d14f58f5b7fd54e0187ddc73790c3986b6f906396ba733338823b8e99640c1794d84bcc0a8862b2e18fb964601739", "b93603f69bb902d6bc4a15e32e34bac0942d14f58f5b7fd54e0187ddc73790c3986b6f906396ba733338823b8e99640c1794d84bcc0a8862b2e18fb964601739"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('9854f986-b3b7-4e16-aee8-b6eb68ced545'::uuid,'LAGRANGE''S APPROACH TO FLOW CHARACTERISTICS','METHOD','{"{\"название\": \"LAGRANGE''S APPROACH TO FLOW CHARACTERISTICS\", \"описание\": \"(Lagrangian approach) Tracing a specific fluid particle''s movement history to describe its motion u\"}"}','(Lagrangian approach) Tracing a specific fluid particle''s movement history to describe its motion using fundamental physical laws','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["16d392b029485723ce65bbac01611d8cea0ac0a495dfcec849dfe0fb70a7ecd2ca1be47fb6b9a17cde8832f82f25c06409dae658149352efbf16e7cc4637347b", "16d392b029485723ce65bbac01611d8cea0ac0a495dfcec849dfe0fb70a7ecd2ca1be47fb6b9a17cde8832f82f25c06409dae658149352efbf16e7cc4637347b"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
