	 ('1b23fc1b-8480-4084-908b-28e3c782a5fc'::uuid,'WING','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"WING\", \"описание\": \"WING is an essential component in aviation design, primarily used to generate lift and balance the w\"}"}','WING is an essential component in aviation design, primarily used to generate lift and balance the weight of the aircraft. In early aviation development, wings played a fundamental role as one of the core elements enabling flight. Typically, wing models for testing purposes are constructed at specific dimensions, such as 1 meter by 200 millimeters, ensuring precise aerodynamic analysis in wind tunnels. These tests often adhere to a standard aspect ratio of 5, which helps in optimizing lift and reducing drag, contributing significantly to the overall performance and efficiency of aircraft designs.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "1da91bb28bf499aa452aef24bdc7beda85be6ecae6149f90b2e07f2f861825f24d62bd32ebcad839db4c303b984e2f9501bb42a9c684162f8dd2f4dd5d838fb0"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
