	 ('7d0e84a0-b032-43ca-a9ce-77179f468188'::uuid,'AERODYNAMIC FORCES','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"AERODYNAMIC FORCES\", \"описание\": \"Forces that cause deformation in aerodynamic bodies\"}"}','Forces that cause deformation in aerodynamic bodies','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["16d392b029485723ce65bbac01611d8cea0ac0a495dfcec849dfe0fb70a7ecd2ca1be47fb6b9a17cde8832f82f25c06409dae658149352efbf16e7cc4637347b"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('a2b2f63d-128f-4c31-8a0a-5b5548c1dae8'::uuid,'LUDWIG PRANDTL','RESEARCHER','{}','Ludwig Prandtl''s 1904 work provided the first comprehensive solution to fluid flow mechanics and improved understanding of lift and drag, particularly through his study of boundary layers','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["da2c68ea72d6096891cf006fbb7859eb6086b57f5f126736a57dd65bf1b0e2133cdc19753df3049b79ab1e71a91e46e9d3764b949686b623843529cf5f38774b", "da2c68ea72d6096891cf006fbb7859eb6086b57f5f126736a57dd65bf1b0e2133cdc19753df3049b79ab1e71a91e46e9d3764b949686b623843529cf5f38774b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('9e610edc-273a-4950-ad57-11bcadb7e2cd'::uuid,'TOWED TRIALS','TEST','{}','TOWED TRIALS is a test technique involving the towing of bodies through the air to conduct drag and lift testing. This method was commonly employed prior to the widespread adoption and advancement of wind tunnel testing techniques. Towed trials served as a crucial means for evaluating aerodynamic properties and performance characteristics of various objects, including aircraft components or models, under controlled conditions before more sophisticated wind tunnel facilities became prevalent in the aerospace industry.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["da2c68ea72d6096891cf006fbb7859eb6086b57f5f126736a57dd65bf1b0e2133cdc19753df3049b79ab1e71a91e46e9d3764b949686b623843529cf5f38774b", "da2c68ea72d6096891cf006fbb7859eb6086b57f5f126736a57dd65bf1b0e2133cdc19753df3049b79ab1e71a91e46e9d3764b949686b623843529cf5f38774b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('57a7ecfd-2b5a-453e-b7df-8ca5bea3b5e5'::uuid,'LA FRANCE','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"LA FRANCE\", \"описание\": \"The French military electric-powered airship developed in 1884 by Charles Renard and Arthur Krebs, c\"}"}','The French military electric-powered airship developed in 1884 by Charles Renard and Arthur Krebs, covering 8 km in 23 minutes with an 8.5 hp engine','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["335e085fd6d0950373e690c3dfa99dacf6ded0df7007db03f94def10a1aeb7d55a54302596740d65bce43516315326647e94e473b0df3e8a1e385c4dcd8ff1b1"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('083ec8c3-c65e-4f84-bf87-ecc588dc5f16'::uuid,'BASIC FLUID MECHANICS','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"BASIC FLUID MECHANICS\", \"описание\": \"Fundamental principles and concepts related to the flow of fluids which are less understood in early\"}"}','Fundamental principles and concepts related to the flow of fluids which are less understood in early aero research','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('7f92cf11-7177-483d-9d22-992c92341d14'::uuid,'FREE WIND TRIALS','PART','{"{\"название\": \"FREE WIND TRIALS\", \"описание\": \"A part of Free and Semi-free flight techniques involving the observation of object movement in natur\"}"}','A part of Free and Semi-free flight techniques involving the observation of object movement in natural airflow without additional forces such as towed air','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('49b21c31-38e3-4944-89fa-121e0dbc9755'::uuid,'THEORETICAL DEVELOPMENTS IN FLUID MECHANICS','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"THEORETICAL DEVELOPMENTS IN FLUID MECHANICS\", \"описание\": \"THEORETICAL DEVELOPMENTS IN FLUID MECHANICS is an academic area that focuses on the study of princip\"}"}','THEORETICAL DEVELOPMENTS IN FLUID MECHANICS is an academic area that focuses on the study of principles and behaviors associated with fluid flow. This field relies heavily on rigorous theoretical analysis to explore and understand various phenomena related to fluids in motion, including their interactions within different environments and under varying conditions. Through this analytical approach, researchers in this discipline aim to develop a deeper understanding of complex fluid dynamics, contributing significantly to advancements in areas such as aerodynamics, hydrodynamics, and the design of efficient energy systems.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('66dd9569-b9a1-46f0-943c-b29c20b6d4f9'::uuid,'MODERN MEASUREMENT TOOLS','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"MODERN MEASUREMENT TOOLS\", \"описание\": \"\\\"Modern Measurement Tools\\\" represent significant advancements in technological development that enab\"}"}','"Modern Measurement Tools" represent significant advancements in technological development that enabled precise and accurate measurements essential for validating fluid mechanics theories. These tools have bridged the gap between historical theoretical foundations laid down by philosophers such as Aristotle and practical experimental methods. Examples of early practical experiments included whirling arms and drop tests, which provided valuable empirical data to support or challenge the established theories. As technology evolved, these initial methods gave way to more sophisticated instruments that enhanced measurement accuracy, facilitating a deeper understanding of fluid dynamics. This progression from traditional approaches to modern technologies highlights the interplay between theoretical knowledge and experimental validation in the field of fluid mechanics.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03", "98f5af20b50979a6ceae00e0e262a4696f43fcd93e841c5eef7dcf55961a4513c7b0217df7f06d0572fe3bf238235fca6779737f60a3dedb4741275610b14f03"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('463b24bf-e926-4597-9dbb-c5a06a9aa26d'::uuid,'AIR','MATERIAL','{"{\"название\": \"AIR\", \"описание\": \"Air is a fluid that rushes into potential vacuums created when objects are in motion.\"}"}','Air is a fluid that rushes into potential vacuums created when objects are in motion.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["9e10720d8940a92e4cb58f1bbba8fe75c8a91e85474223b792dbc80444a1fa4dbf9183cca9e48a6d7ad55762d1099a1f77e0c2f98fb57732b6605de4fdcda42c"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('f4dbfdba-9c34-4235-a90e-66eb9b57baa5'::uuid,'POTENTIAL VACUUM','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"POTENTIAL VACUUM\", \"описание\": \"A system where air rushes to fill the gap between moving objects and other stationary obstructions, \"}"}','A system where air rushes to fill the gap between moving objects and other stationary obstructions, allowing continuous motion.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["9e10720d8940a92e4cb58f1bbba8fe75c8a91e85474223b792dbc80444a1fa4dbf9183cca9e48a6d7ad55762d1099a1f77e0c2f98fb57732b6605de4fdcda42c"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics');
