	 ('2437ff3c-978f-4ea1-bab2-6f42ca704954'::uuid,'PASSENGER FLIGHT','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"PASSENGER FLIGHT\", \"описание\": \"First instance of human flight with a passenger1783, marking a leap from experimental to practical u\"}"}','First instance of human flight with a passenger1783, marking a leap from experimental to practical use','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["d54c07ac8327b71b66713db09c704c4ad7a27589908a44f20e1f82f6862ae8906f07bdd5f724a455c02b8ccd11318bb80dcc8b5fca7721aaa202a67c6b5b51bb"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('308fef04-b04b-4661-a421-d9d819415e6c'::uuid,'SHARP ENTRANCE LEADING EDGE','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"SHARP ENTRANCE LEADING EDGE\", \"описание\": \"\\\"SHARP ENTRANCE LEADING EDGE\\\" refers to a notable feature in early wind tunnel designs. These leadin\"}"}','"SHARP ENTRANCE LEADING EDGE" refers to a notable feature in early wind tunnel designs. These leading edges, characterized by their sharpness, induced significant flow separation issues during testing. This caused substantial complexities and the need for long settling lengths before accurate measurements could be obtained. The entry points of these wind tunnels were prone to generating flow separation due to their geometry, making initial model testing unreliable until adequate settling had occurred. This characteristic was a common challenge faced by engineers as they refined early models to achieve more precise and efficient testing conditions in wind tunnel environments.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["653aa46087e791b134dbbd802cc7f2be070fd13ba9b27acc8585793069a21cb0efa3b5f8653b3d05323cc3ed759a463b78204a2bc4749488e28d38de3050a9cc", "653aa46087e791b134dbbd802cc7f2be070fd13ba9b27acc8585793069a21cb0efa3b5f8653b3d05323cc3ed759a463b78204a2bc4749488e28d38de3050a9cc"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('e2332086-5833-4fdd-a36b-5da8c7324822'::uuid,'GUNPOWDER ENGINE','MATERIAL','{"{\"название\": \"GUNPOWDER ENGINE\", \"описание\": \"The \\\"GUNPOWDER ENGINE,\\\" an experimental engine developed in the late 19th century by Sir George Cayl\"}"}','The "GUNPOWDER ENGINE," an experimental engine developed in the late 19th century by Sir George Cayley, aimed to power aircraft. However, the engine did not meet the requirements for being both powerful and reliable. This engineering attempt was part of Cayley''s broader efforts in aviation research during a time when early pioneers were exploring ways to solve the challenges of sustained powered flight.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c", "4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c", "4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('240c42d4-6e12-4986-a251-78e4a80b4d95'::uuid,'PÉNAUD''S RUBBER MOTOR POWERED GLIDER','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"PÉNAUD''S RUBBER MOTOR POWERED GLIDER\", \"описание\": \"PÉNAUD''S RUBBER-MOTOR POWERED GLIDER, developed in 1871, is noted for its historical significance a\"}"}','PÉNAUD''S RUBBER-MOTOR POWERED GLIDER, developed in 1871, is noted for its historical significance as an important milestone in the evolution of powered flight. This aircraft was a stable design capable of flying over 39 meters and represented a key advancement by early aviation pioneers towards achieving controlled, powered flight.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c", "4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c", "4089000a7a5f43c1f79ebd955ed69dab8fc13c6f0153fe4c6ae9df3fdfa0ecdfc28e259193c210fc04e64e6f124fe76ccb1f7ccbb3e5ccb8e8d848fbdfd2ef5c"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
