	 ('c5b57618-9e14-4f35-9118-519632542f46'::uuid,'WELLINGTON','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"WELLINGTON\", \"описание\": \"Wellington''s train tests, conducted in 1878, focused on the accuracy and interference challenges of\"}"}','"Wellington''s train tests, conducted in 1878, focused on the accuracy and interference challenges of towed experiments. By testing bodies mounted on a train, he highlighted issues like wake effects that might affect test reliability."','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["573d5db6e587374521f111a47eaa08e2ce573235b08716d91bbe053504fe503530293339ede873a3ac356c3d376fcb97e005ef76112125385fa9e127d8e42fec", "573d5db6e587374521f111a47eaa08e2ce573235b08716d91bbe053504fe503530293339ede873a3ac356c3d376fcb97e005ef76112125385fa9e127d8e42fec"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics');
