	 ('242a4bab-8653-4260-b044-eb2c6de3b21d'::uuid,'IDEAL GAS MODEL','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"IDEAL GAS MODEL\", \"описание\": \"The IDEAL GAS MODEL is a simplified representation often utilized in the study of gas dynamics, part\"}"}','The IDEAL GAS MODEL is a simplified representation often utilized in the study of gas dynamics, particularly where compressibility effects are important but thermal effects can be neglected. This model finds application in observing transonic motions, which occur when gases transition between subsonic and supersonic speeds without considering substantial changes in temperature.
