	 ('648b9103-a4e3-40d8-8990-23bad6c5e837'::uuid,'ADER','ORGANIZATION','{}','Early aircraft maker who attempted to build flying machines; his achievements are noted as part of the timeline for early attempts at man-powered flight','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39", "61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('3f1c00e0-aa59-4e2a-b7e8-7c929a3e2f6c'::uuid,'WRIGHTS','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"WRIGHTS\", \"описание\": \"The Wright brothers, known for their significant contributions to aviation history with their pionee\"}"}','The Wright brothers, known for their significant contributions to aviation history with their pioneering efforts leading to successful powered, controlled flights','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39", "61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('8c40106f-676c-4d26-b2bc-c77a03895a51'::uuid,'LANGLEY','ORGANIZATION','{}','Langley''s advancements in aeronautical engineering and research are important in the context of evolving into more efficient forms of aircraft and powered controlled human flight','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39", "61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('c819ea0d-8fb9-4aab-a4c7-2d2c1c67eac5'::uuid,'GIBBS-SMITH','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"GIBBS-SMITH\", \"описание\": \"GIBBS-SMITH is a historian renowned for compiling and documenting the critical figures and chronolog\"}"}','GIBBS-SMITH is a historian renowned for compiling and documenting the critical figures and chronological milestones in the early advancements of powered flight. Their extensive research provides valuable insights into the pioneers and events that shaped this significant period in aviation history, offering a comprehensive timeline of developments from the inception to the early stages of powered flight technology.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39", "61646302e3bc960c352c6408cdc69191dab988abf38ec4bf7f2e4174aba91d86396e3e37ae38ca304afb1a34043af419361016661c11be52244507e7a8027a39"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('95a759cf-aa56-4bf9-b0ae-15884c62c8a3'::uuid,'LUNDBERG WHIRLING ARM DEVICE','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"LUNDBERG WHIRLING ARM DEVICE\", \"описание\": \"Cayley''s whirling arm device was used to conduct experiments on aerofoil properties like lift and d\"}"}','Cayley''s whirling arm device was used to conduct experiments on aerofoil properties like lift and drag, leading to the discovery of better lift from cambered surfaces. It also helped in understanding centre of pressure positioning.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["f5cd08a5bba8e5f1cac73b2168b03f440d049e82b880cf5ff9b03a61f932ab149f55ecbff1e2e45fc298cd176b96304c704c6f0d04ce87977c3be47e617c941b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('9a73aaa9-b0d3-4054-9c74-e9abdb0377f3'::uuid,'WHIRLING ARM EXPERIMENTS','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"WHIRLING ARM EXPERIMENTS\", \"описание\": \"These were a series of experiments conducted by Cayley on his whirling arm device to study the force\"}"}','These were a series of experiments conducted by Cayley on his whirling arm device to study the forces acting on airfoils, contributing significantly to early aviation concepts.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["f5cd08a5bba8e5f1cac73b2168b03f440d049e82b880cf5ff9b03a61f932ab149f55ecbff1e2e45fc298cd176b96304c704c6f0d04ce87977c3be47e617c941b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('48e36647-7ee4-4329-b6e8-2e2cba221ea7'::uuid,'LATERAL STABILITY DIHEDRAL DEVICE','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"LATERAL STABILITY DIHEDRAL DEVICE\", \"описание\": \"Dihedral was used in Cayley''s designs to achieve lateral stability.\"}"}','Dihedral was used in Cayley''s designs to achieve lateral stability.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["f5cd08a5bba8e5f1cac73b2168b03f440d049e82b880cf5ff9b03a61f932ab149f55ecbff1e2e45fc298cd176b96304c704c6f0d04ce87977c3be47e617c941b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('c35f6a03-64c8-4d9a-9d6a-51b99b500ccb'::uuid,'POWER UNITS OF CAYLEY','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"POWER UNITS OF CAYLEY\", \"описание\": \"While Cayley experimented with power units like compressed air or explosives, he did not succeed in \"}"}','While Cayley experimented with power units like compressed air or explosives, he did not succeed in powering his machines effectively.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["f5cd08a5bba8e5f1cac73b2168b03f440d049e82b880cf5ff9b03a61f932ab149f55ecbff1e2e45fc298cd176b96304c704c6f0d04ce87977c3be47e617c941b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('0f272903-5d5c-494c-8617-705be2e6e9c6'::uuid,'PROPULSION SYSTEM OF MAXIM','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"PROPULSION SYSTEM OF MAXIM\", \"описание\": \"Maxim’s propulsion system involved a complex setup but it was insufficient for effectively powering \"}"}','Maxim’s propulsion system involved a complex setup but it was insufficient for effectively powering his aircraft design fully.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["f5cd08a5bba8e5f1cac73b2168b03f440d049e82b880cf5ff9b03a61f932ab149f55ecbff1e2e45fc298cd176b96304c704c6f0d04ce87977c3be47e617c941b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('418cbdd9-5e5d-439f-8589-d68ed7fd3476'::uuid,'WRIGHT SISTERS','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"WRIGHT SISTERS\", \"описание\": \"While not explicitly mentioned, their contribution as part of the broader context can be inferred. T\"}"}','While not explicitly mentioned, their contribution as part of the broader context can be inferred. The Wright sisters supported and played various roles in helping their brother Wilbur and Orville with early aviation experiments.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["f5cd08a5bba8e5f1cac73b2168b03f440d049e82b880cf5ff9b03a61f932ab149f55ecbff1e2e45fc298cd176b96304c704c6f0d04ce87977c3be47e617c941b"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics');
