	 ('d2164831-a9a5-42a8-96b9-a3e9c60d2c89'::uuid,'LIFTING LINE THEORY','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"LIFTING LINE THEORY\", \"описание\": \"\\\"The lifting line theory\\\" is a theoretical approach to determine the lift on an airfoil based on its\"}"}','"The lifting line theory" is a theoretical approach to determine the lift on an airfoil based on its circulation and was developed primarily by Prandtl and contemporaries. It considers the vortices induced along the wing span (principally in the boundary layer) that contribute to lift}.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["5985fc6749a64fb8e61f7a2dcaeb6777591d07e107e27e9f81ec141746d44adcac5a3c9000993f0f170c0b6328ef2350e35bc72f717da15ff3420d8f6ff42f91"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
