	 ('8b0f7bbf-a923-482e-88a9-09d24a9b630f'::uuid,'UNMANNED GLIDERS','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"UNMANNED GLIDERS\", \"описание\": \"Francis Herbert Wenham attempted to build and test unmanned gliders but was unsuccessful in achievin\"}"}','Francis Herbert Wenham attempted to build and test unmanned gliders but was unsuccessful in achieving manned flights, emphasizing the importance of wing shape for lift','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["faa334cc3a5b50c3cebcf1df46beb7be9ad777690802933a651dec6cbd0da34c9fef6dd95627eca4b6a746fc7c67bc72b217d1c4e60e92895dbfef4b8412f573", "faa334cc3a5b50c3cebcf1df46beb7be9ad777690802933a651dec6cbd0da34c9fef6dd95627eca4b6a746fc7c67bc72b217d1c4e60e92895dbfef4b8412f573"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('67d0ccbc-7b4f-49dc-9ea2-2918c68705e1'::uuid,'FRANCIS HERBERT WENHAM','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"FRANCIS HERBERT WENHAM\", \"описание\": \"Francis Herbert Wenham attempted to build unmanned gliders and concluded that long thin wings would \"}"}','Francis Herbert Wenham attempted to build unmanned gliders and concluded that long thin wings would be more effective than bat-like wings due to their longer leading edge','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('aa449033-0a26-462c-a1bd-6cf983ac6540'::uuid,'BIRD-LIKE WING','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"BIRD-LIKE WING\", \"описание\": \"The term \\\"BIRD-LIKE WING\\\" refers to a wing design that mirrors key aspects of avian anatomy. This de\"}"}','The term "BIRD-LIKE WING" refers to a wing design that mirrors key aspects of avian anatomy. This design focuses on the significant contribution of the front parts of the wing in generating lift, drawing inspiration directly from bird physiology. According to the research by Wenham, this characteristic is crucial for optimizing flight capabilities. The wing''s structure is meticulously crafted to mimic natural bird wings, enhancing its efficiency and effectiveness in various aerodynamic environments. This approach ensures that the leading edge of the wing—a critical component—plays a pivotal role in producing lift, mimicking nature’s sophisticated design in aviation engineering.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e", "a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('9dfd15f0-70f9-4069-83e8-81b5bf8d5583'::uuid,'PARACHTHTE MODEL','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"PARACHTHTE MODEL\", \"описание\": \"Model proposed by Leonardo da Vinci for reducing fall speed. Demonstrated principles of drag and lif\"}"}','Model proposed by Leonardo da Vinci for reducing fall speed. Demonstrated principles of drag and lift.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["a5d4719b2541caf004e1082010054faa38c7ba80d90b5f7e39636fab5592ad3861a1d6acd00ebc78dac62d343df8f5398463149ba9cee12a0171444fbc1a02ad", "a5d4719b2541caf004e1082010054faa38c7ba80d90b5f7e39636fab5592ad3861a1d6acd00ebc78dac62d343df8f5398463149ba9cee12a0171444fbc1a02ad"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1');
