	 ('514920b1-21a9-4cc9-9341-dec6b1b0381e'::uuid,'INDUCED DRAG','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"INDUCED DRAG\", \"описание\": \"Induced drag is a result of trailing vortices, which decrease the lift and efficiency of an aircraft\"}"}','Induced drag is a result of trailing vortices, which decrease the lift and efficiency of an aircraft''s wing','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["0c3066d68702b9a95d3c6349961939cc0cdb2cfcee05bf4298cfa0536ee2bfedf182bf64728e68df41dcf90db30eb0fb1a9f16c3810a50ad768499953f0d9018"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('41e0e0d1-c5c7-493e-bcf3-6c2701ac7c17'::uuid,'SIMPLE METAL CRYSTALS','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"SIMPLE METAL CRYSTALS\", \"описание\": \"Simple metals crystallize into highly symmetric structures such as cubic cells, showcasing uniform a\"}"}','Simple metals crystallize into highly symmetric structures such as cubic cells, showcasing uniform atomic arrangements','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["de853bfe49f3934f3f091e273d7f490dd0799663d94d77bcd0cf7c1bbdee2bd4306455461b629588031c9581ff98e284a6026eebc4f0f469865a92862692afbc"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1'),
	 ('f125efeb-25ed-4113-9d31-d152697f4c34'::uuid,'ENGINEERED DEVICES','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"ENGINEERED DEVICES\", \"описание\": \"The ENGINEERED DEVICES discussed were specifically designed for purposes related to gliders and wind\"}"}','The ENGINEERED DEVICES discussed were specifically designed for purposes related to gliders and wind tunnels. These devices exemplify early practical contributions to the field of aviation research, highlighting significant advancements in understanding aerodynamics and airplane design during an initial phase of exploration and innovation. Through their construction and utilization, these engineered tools facilitated foundational studies essential for the development of more advanced aircraft technologies.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e", "a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('080bb00f-e8e8-4ad3-b9b0-03f6bf148654'::uuid,'HEAVYER-THAN-AIR CRAFT','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"HEAVYER-THAN-AIR CRAFT\", \"описание\": \"Term referring to aircraft which have a greater weight than air during operation, supported by the d\"}"}','Term referring to aircraft which have a greater weight than air during operation, supported by the demonstration of increased lift performance in Wenham''s research','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e", "a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('f070ce9a-2475-4cf1-8aa4-008a5d79d492'::uuid,'JOHN J. MONTGOMERY''S GLIDER','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"JOHN J. MONTGOMERY''S GLIDER\", \"описание\": \"First truly modern glider constructed near San Diego in 1883, capable of controlled flight with the \"}"}','First truly modern glider constructed near San Diego in 1883, capable of controlled flight with the help of a wind tunnel','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e", "a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('3e81aaeb-0380-4373-902b-3a5f3791fdc2'::uuid,'OTTO LILIENTHAL''S RESEARCH','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"OTTO LILIENTHAL''S RESEARCH\", \"описание\": \"OTTO LILIENTHAL''S RESEARCH focused extensively on the development of wing design and stability, bui\"}"}','OTTO LILIENTHAL''S RESEARCH focused extensively on the development of wing design and stability, building upon the earlier experiments conducted by Wenham. This body of work, resulting in a publication in 1889, substantiated and expanded the foundational findings established by Wenham. Lilienthal''s research was pivotal in advancing the field, as it not only refined existing theories but also provided critical insights that laid groundwork for future aviation developments.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e", "a1689fa4557c7bd9828498b6af22e4d56a6e70b706bc03a66df0ec58854f6cb93cfb6e67be14e6cf7954609e79e3b6bd423a0ba59422819f13f132672854041e"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
