	 ('7e5ba904-7572-45d9-9fe8-0ebc7a225249'::uuid,'RENARD69 AIRSHIP TUNNEL/','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"RENARD69 AIRSHIP TUNNEL/\", \"описание\": \"A smaller tunnel built by Renard in 1896 with a diameter of 0.81 meters to measure air drag for airs\"}"}','A smaller tunnel built by Renard in 1896 with a diameter of 0.81 meters to measure air drag for airships. The flow was reported to be poor due to lack of effort in improving it.<|','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["9b04b65904320d152e1a24cfa860cad23a1e8cf8a6b3402f1434285bed985ebbf31d5bfe08c052a7e873eb3dccd9ad3800832d2194ca94adad02b5f4b8043f99"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('30b0268f-05fd-4e65-a355-9537818e1fab'::uuid,'NAVIER–STOKES EQUATIONS','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"NAVIER–STOKES EQUATIONS\", \"описание\": \"The NAVIER–STOKES equations are mathematical tools crucial for analyzing fluid dynamics where the ef\"}"}','The NAVIER–STOKES equations are mathematical tools crucial for analyzing fluid dynamics where the effects of viscosity cannot be neglected. These equations provide a more intricate and accurate description compared to other methods such as Lagrange formulas, especially in scenarios involving incompressible fluids or gases. They are particularly useful for describing the behavior of low-velocity flows, taking into account the viscosity effects that significantly influence the fluid''s motion. The ability to model these detailed dynamics makes the NAVIER–STOKES equations indispensable in fields ranging from aerospace engineering to meteorology and beyond.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 4, "text_unit_ids": ["83b687d2a25f7bd062db6c7a8395f195ec5f35fb59d004dba2633089b9ca6d93c92d704d07504499c4a535bf564205b86b4d80913963c786d24fb4656ced0f70", "83b687d2a25f7bd062db6c7a8395f195ec5f35fb59d004dba2633089b9ca6d93c92d704d07504499c4a535bf564205b86b4d80913963c786d24fb4656ced0f70", "c39119a42bf54d5f3a6c528527afa0659b9429b38912e2720b5ab4f6ac9e9979a2f0357e21700957de3eeda5bfae120fd0986c0cbb00355505e8e2ddc1e849ac", "c39119a42bf54d5f3a6c528527afa0659b9429b38912e2720b5ab4f6ac9e9979a2f0357e21700957de3eeda5bfae120fd0986c0cbb00355505e8e2ddc1e849ac"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
