	 ('58473df0-436b-4e7b-9083-62f5ea7e6354'::uuid,'FLYING LANTERN','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"FLYING LANTERN\", \"описание\": \"The flying lantern, a paper container holding an oil lamp that rises due to heated air, used in anci\"}"}','The flying lantern, a paper container holding an oil lamp that rises due to heated air, used in ancient combat tactics','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["93598286bf41252a5653b865693926a10004c8895f439d179e7df23951875f9be08961897007b5955c71dd93076ae3119f0c8ca810440b7e216291c012b3265d"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('d9b7f7cf-951c-47c9-99a8-45eacf06733e'::uuid,'LAGARI HASAN CELEBI''S FLIGHT','EVENT','{}','"LAGARI HASAN CELEBI''S FLIGHT" refers to a historical event associated with Lagari Hasan Celebi, an Ottoman aviator who is credited with attempting the first manned rocket flight in recorded history. This fictional but historically significant entity represents an important milestone in the realm of early aeronautical experimentation.
