	 ('db440895-15d4-47ad-9f75-9c6b4c443c25'::uuid,'RELATIVE DENSITY','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"RELATIVE DENSITY\", \"описание\": \"Determined by the formula Δ = ρ / ρ₀, measuring how a substance''s density compares to that of some \"}"}','Determined by the formula Δ = ρ / ρ₀, measuring how a substance''s density compares to that of some reference material. In air, it relates to the ratio of its mass per unit volume compared to another gas or air itself at standard conditions.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["bf26f5a3b6530571e586bf2e521de1606936d166f7ecd17a2fda3301e6731802baf11ea7e937d0ec458325da1ec98c55af85370ad15325184313eb3e41a92807"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
