	 ('b7522b19-b943-4b15-a404-34cf099611ba'::uuid,'FORCES (MECHANISM)','INTERNAL FORCES','{}','Internal forces arise due to the application of external forces on structures. Analysis of these forces helps in understanding structural behavior under load conditions.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["4d17cb174f068dafef4955c063dda439983eb954edea151dfad9f5fd051527139fbc2909f4089dcf5c34e6677610c6d486b30f2b11e396bcfec49cedac0b1d4e"]}','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','sopromat_v1'),
	 ('7d19a73a-22f2-47ca-817e-facb8e7581a9'::uuid,'SHELL','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"SHELL\", \"описание\": \"Shell is a structural element covered under the scope of strength of materials that can behave diffe\"}"}','Shell is a structural element covered under the scope of strength of materials that can behave differently from a rod or plate when subjected to external forces','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["4d17cb174f068dafef4955c063dda439983eb954edea151dfad9f5fd051527139fbc2909f4089dcf5c34e6677610c6d486b30f2b11e396bcfec49cedac0b1d4e", "4d17cb174f068dafef4955c063dda439983eb954edea151dfad9f5fd051527139fbc2909f4089dcf5c34e6677610c6d486b30f2b11e396bcfec49cedac0b1d4e"]}','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','sopromat_v1'),
	 ('1d72abd5-7c97-44ca-b2a0-d61e6ad62161'::uuid,'SOLID BODY','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"SOLID BODY\", \"описание\": \"Solid body, alongside rods, plates, and shells, forms part of the main elements in studies regarding\"}"}','Solid body, alongside rods, plates, and shells, forms part of the main elements in studies regarding strength of materials. It is another form used for considering elements under analysis.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["4d17cb174f068dafef4955c063dda439983eb954edea151dfad9f5fd051527139fbc2909f4089dcf5c34e6677610c6d486b30f2b11e396bcfec49cedac0b1d4e", "4d17cb174f068dafef4955c063dda439983eb954edea151dfad9f5fd051527139fbc2909f4089dcf5c34e6677610c6d486b30f2b11e396bcfec49cedac0b1d4e"]}','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','sopromat_v1');
