	 ('ea1eab96-9044-48f2-b4bb-971fdb46143c'::uuid,'CELL PARAMETER OR LATTICE PARAMETER','MODEL','{"{\"название\": \"CELL PARAMETER OR LATTICE PARAMETER\", \"описание\": \"In a crystal lattice, distances between nearest atoms are chosen as cell parameters or lattice param\"}"}','In a crystal lattice, distances between nearest atoms are chosen as cell parameters or lattice parameters; these parameters along with angles fully describe the unit cell shape','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["de853bfe49f3934f3f091e273d7f490dd0799663d94d77bcd0cf7c1bbdee2bd4306455461b629588031c9581ff98e284a6026eebc4f0f469865a92862692afbc"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1'),
	 ('ce1bda57-12ef-4772-8a9c-c58607f9aa93'::uuid,'WIGNER-SEIZT CELL','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"WIGNER-SEIZT CELL\", \"описание\": \"The Wigner–Seitz cell plays an important role in the theory of electronic properties of solids and i\"}"}','The Wigner–Seitz cell plays an important role in the theory of electronic properties of solids and is defined by the unit cell enclosed by planes. The main property associated with it is long-range order or translational symmetry','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["091c2bdcc29b966207eedad51eb8990dd1419da9354df05045326857c5fbf87d3c068e7c25d9b5302985a77f5c66a9a1a57d7703770ab76d586d72af540195a3"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1'),
	 ('d0754bc1-b644-45b8-af2f-9e483dfbe2d4'::uuid,'CRYSTAL','MATERIAL','{"{\"название\": \"CRYSTAL\", \"описание\": \"A solid material characterized by long-range order or translational symmetry and defined by its atom\"}"}','A solid material characterized by long-range order or translational symmetry and defined by its atomic arrangement. It can be understood through the concepts of unit cells and lattices','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["091c2bdcc29b966207eedad51eb8990dd1419da9354df05045326857c5fbf87d3c068e7c25d9b5302985a77f5c66a9a1a57d7703770ab76d586d72af540195a3"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1'),
