	 ('e32a9066-4c11-4477-a5e8-73a9a208aa90'::uuid,'MODEL','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"MODEL\", \"описание\": \"The entity \\\"MODEL\\\" refers to a critical component in flight research. Models were employed not only \"}"}','The entity "MODEL" refers to a critical component in flight research. Models were employed not only as isolated structures but also integrated into complete devices for various research purposes. These models played an essential role in aerodynamic testing and design validation, serving as physical representations that could be subjected to real-world conditions without the risks associated with full-scale aircraft.
