	 ('5309b098-2ec4-482e-8abb-0fdbfd133545'::uuid,'LIFT','PROPERTY','{"{\"название\": \"LIFT\", \"описание\": \"The force that keeps an airplane in the air by counteracting gravity and allowing it to ascend or ma\"}"}','The force that keeps an airplane in the air by counteracting gravity and allowing it to ascend or maintain altitude','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6", "29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('fd8504e3-0e83-488b-af2e-86505a0030be'::uuid,'YAW','PROPERTY','{"{\"название\": \"YAW\", \"описание\": \"The rotation around an aircraft''s vertical axis, essential for heading control during flight\"}"}','The rotation around an aircraft''s vertical axis, essential for heading control during flight','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["29d7b9fb394697229d5c6ee7e8e7498c26b62969f8ef9bf5c71dde024c555e26c654c119dc856911c2890b719150da3d3016b67a8e15863bf865abc974c1efb6"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('7fbf9843-96a6-4b1a-8d0a-dfbd8f5d9781'::uuid,'WHIRLING ARM DEVICES','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"WHIRLING ARM DEVICES\", \"описание\": \"Whirling Arm Devices were utilized to measure flow resistance through the application of a known fal\"}"}','Whirling Arm Devices were utilized to measure flow resistance through the application of a known falling weight as a motive force. These devices, however, had limitations due to their inability to account for the wake effects caused by rotating tested items that experienced disturbed flow conditions. This inherent drawback persisted until advancements in technology during the 20th century introduced more reliable pitot-static tubes, which helped mitigate these issues by better accounting for the complex fluid dynamics involved. Despite this improvement, Whirling Arm Devices remained a critical tool for early flow measurement studies, providing foundational insights into fluid resistance that were essential for subsequent developments in aerodynamics and hydrodynamics.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["75e55aae79fa4fef8afa00e4bf79f6f1f694d27b10f227c1f393bd8cf61700080ce3c057271ae7311d2d3cd09b4445ff1281543e67c2ce7840a138c9f1467077", "75e55aae79fa4fef8afa00e4bf79f6f1f694d27b10f227c1f393bd8cf61700080ce3c057271ae7311d2d3cd09b4445ff1281543e67c2ce7840a138c9f1467077"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
