	 ('de673617-61ce-416f-90ac-fbe3eb58b850'::uuid,'MUSCULAR POWER','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"MUSCULAR POWER\", \"описание\": \"Refers to the muscular effort applied by the pilot without mechanical apparatuses. It was used as an\"}"}','Refers to the muscular effort applied by the pilot without mechanical apparatuses. It was used as an energy source before fixed-winged aircraft had motors driven by non-human factors.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["5f6fd011c9ca704fc492591b733a486799017472d116244888b93e9d7d7bc92c33215f95b7a0a6f3c020f6ed022aa38e6f8f3044d9ae52a1e579de70fa928ad5", "5f6fd011c9ca704fc492591b733a486799017472d116244888b93e9d7d7bc92c33215f95b7a0a6f3c020f6ed022aa38e6f8f3044d9ae52a1e579de70fa928ad5"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('45dc21c2-b3bb-49cb-a73c-ea0ab9e66785'::uuid,'PARACHUTE','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"PARACHUTE\", \"описание\": \"The parachute is adevice primarily designed to slow the descent of an object through the air by gene\"}"}','The parachute is adevice primarily designed to slow the descent of an object through the air by generating aerodynamic drag force. This device has been utilized for various purposes, including ensuring safe landings from heights when jumping or falling.
