	 ('21ca80a0-56c9-4e73-97dc-0f5af8149a90'::uuid,'MAXIM','PERSON','{"{\"название\": \"MAXIM\", \"описание\": \"MAXIM was a pivotal early aviation pioneer, recognized for his groundbreaking contributions to the d\"}"}','MAXIM was a pivotal early aviation pioneer, recognized for his groundbreaking contributions to the development of practical flying machines in the late 19th century. His work played a crucial role in advancing the timeline towards powered human flight, serving as an essential milestone alongside other notable figures such as Sir George Cayley and François Pilâtre de Rozier.
