	 ('9e922be4-5e31-47c3-9a70-bb884ba2d298'::uuid,'FAN IN MAXIMS TUNNEL','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"FAN IN MAXIMS TUNNEL\", \"описание\": \"Fan-driven by a belt attached to a steam engine which obtained high velocities in Maxim’s 1896 blowd\"}"}','Fan-driven by a belt attached to a steam engine which obtained high velocities in Maxim’s 1896 blowdown tunnel. It had limitations due to insufficient vanes and lack of settling chambers.<|','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["9b04b65904320d152e1a24cfa860cad23a1e8cf8a6b3402f1434285bed985ebbf31d5bfe08c052a7e873eb3dccd9ad3800832d2194ca94adad02b5f4b8043f99"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
