	 ('96cb6362-2587-441e-942a-17b3d28b4dea'::uuid,'VISCOOSITY','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"VISCOOSITY\", \"описание\": \"Viscosity results from the chaotic motion of molecules and affects air and liquid properties, decrea\"}"}','Viscosity results from the chaotic motion of molecules and affects air and liquid properties, decreasing with temperature increase in liquids but increasing in gases under pressure change.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 3, "text_unit_ids": ["28cecdc770c6a89ca87abe00cc7c001435c36f85ccea49414b7b38e0ca90e9c7a34ae80b18f1142de6f051bd2874e60296f40c3fe63d476edda0f8036922ba4c", "28cecdc770c6a89ca87abe00cc7c001435c36f85ccea49414b7b38e0ca90e9c7a34ae80b18f1142de6f051bd2874e60296f40c3fe63d476edda0f8036922ba4c", "28cecdc770c6a89ca87abe00cc7c001435c36f85ccea49414b7b38e0ca90e9c7a34ae80b18f1142de6f051bd2874e60296f40c3fe63d476edda0f8036922ba4c"]}','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','2026-07-17 16:18:55.489892','aerodynamics_v1'),
	 ('545bf09c-bfc6-4956-b554-7f1d1083b9c8'::uuid,'RESIDUAL (PLASTIC) DEFORMATION','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"RESIDUAL (PLASTIC) DEFORMATION\", \"описание\": \"RESIDUAL (PLASTIC) DEFORMATION refers to a type of deformation characterized by permanent changes in\"}"}','RESIDUAL (PLASTIC) DEFORMATION refers to a type of deformation characterized by permanent changes in the dimensions and/or shape of an object. This phenomenon occurs when an external force is applied to a material, causing it to rearrange its molecular structure. Once the load is removed or unloaded, these rearranged molecules do not return to their original state, resulting in a permanent alteration in the material''s form and size. This effect highlights the plastic nature of this deformation, where the material undergoes irreversible changes even after the external force has been removed.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["11c9a21d6a0a9c5abe6f306c213575c0e955cd0c882c3149ea3e9f2422eeedd68b3e55978e3b0c3e8c74dc92b4bcf8a8e937a6aefe488e4d795bda2147b07272", "11c9a21d6a0a9c5abe6f306c213575c0e955cd0c882c3149ea3e9f2422eeedd68b3e55978e3b0c3e8c74dc92b4bcf8a8e937a6aefe488e4d795bda2147b07272"]}','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','2026-07-17 16:45:38.667334','sopromat_v1'),
	 ('a5f614da-6440-4849-ab74-039b59d924b3'::uuid,'LEAD WEIGHTS','COMPONENT','{"{\"название\": \"LEAD WEIGHTS\", \"описание\": \"Material used by Desaguliers in his experiments at St. Paul''s, differing from air-filled bladders o\"}"}','Material used by Desaguliers in his experiments at St. Paul''s, differing from air-filled bladders of earlier tests','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["8e8b5bf24dddb1ddb50b7cbf2d3c92c98694db8e547ae1917342574e7e171cb95e09a476096026b49868f4048da326a354b623333e0ac1b3a5e0a358ea00009f"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('47d445cf-5e12-49e9-9659-9fbc4619d514'::uuid,'PILOT''S BODY MOVEMENT CONTROL','MECHANISM','{"{\"название\": \"PILOT''S BODY MOVEMENT CONTROL\", \"описание\": \"Otto Lilienthal’s control mechanisms relied on the pilot manipulating the center-of-gravity (cg) pos\"}"}','Otto Lilienthal’s control mechanisms relied on the pilot manipulating the center-of-gravity (cg) position through body movement in response to forces exerted by the glider; useful for gliding but inadequate for sustained powered flight','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["ffe9725d362af387144062ce80531a3c181c5efe24e8c5ccb730a3fad8dd8623051f30cc871dc61ff2bf656d91294dc1547d0406b008537b49f8a44cfcec0d79", "ffe9725d362af387144062ce80531a3c181c5efe24e8c5ccb730a3fad8dd8623051f30cc871dc61ff2bf656d91294dc1547d0406b008537b49f8a44cfcec0d79"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
