	 ('21bd10ee-9aa5-4a4e-81af-b403d5c14c9c'::uuid,'HEZÂRFEN AHMED ÇELEBI''S WINGED APPARATUS','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"HEZÂRFEN AHMED ÇELEBI''S WINGED APPARATUS\", \"описание\": \"A device enabling Hezârfen to fly across the Bosphorus from the Galata Tower in 1632\"}"}','A device enabling Hezârfen to fly across the Bosphorus from the Galata Tower in 1632','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["46b667214423448900a64449a21a8d78137e40dbbcde1ff7361b13892626a596937541e8a1dff8c28756c1af322bcfde1298239045005d93a04cd46043247c20"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('127e7d40-36f1-4194-b8b6-547748dc6765'::uuid,'MAN-POWERED GLIDER','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"MAN-POWERED GLIDER\", \"описание\": \"The MAN-POWERED GLIDER is a device that enables people to attempt human flight through their own phy\"}"}','The MAN-POWERED GLIDER is a device that enables people to attempt human flight through their own physical effort. This concept traces back to early experiments such as the one conducted by Ibn Firnas, who, around the 9th or 10th century, invented a flying machine resembling wings. Built with visionary intent for controlled flight, Ibn Firnas'' device inspired later inventors, including Leonardo da Vinci, who conceptualized hang gliders. Together, these pioneering efforts laid the groundwork for future developments in human-powered airplanes and gliders, albeit not initially successful, they contributed significantly to the advancement of aviation technology.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["46b667214423448900a64449a21a8d78137e40dbbcde1ff7361b13892626a596937541e8a1dff8c28756c1af322bcfde1298239045005d93a04cd46043247c20", "46b667214423448900a64449a21a8d78137e40dbbcde1ff7361b13892626a596937541e8a1dff8c28756c1af322bcfde1298239045005d93a04cd46043247c20"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('5815048c-7105-4061-a324-df64b6dc4b4a'::uuid,'SOLID PHASE G_S','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"SOLID PHASE G_S\", \"описание\": \"Gibbs free energy of the solid phase, which becomes stable above a critical temperature T_m relative\"}"}','Gibbs free energy of the solid phase, which becomes stable above a critical temperature T_m relative to the liquid phase','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["3eac214f7fab6c0b35e16309a9844dde6f2c66036fa9039ffca4d76bd4ffe9a1fb7edd786c2fd1c7bd56b5907044f909a896b1fd021161eb1fe0c6c57452b413"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1'),
	 ('7fbf9db6-cf17-472a-bd9b-bf06f4cb34d3'::uuid,'FREE ENERGY, ΔF','MATERIAL','{"{\"название\": \"FREE ENERGY, ΔF\", \"описание\": \"Total free energy change in the system due to nucleus growth and surface area changes during crystal\"}"}','Total free energy change in the system due to nucleus growth and surface area changes during crystallization, composed of volume and surface contributions','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["d6d7f1e636dd37d1d486e1147e50bb55a86e562c7aa76fe7db2fd92b8edc1a5763f08ccea27e0cdfab16c1e418d6907a556395f5d666eb5ad38e350bb4fe96fa"]}','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','2026-07-17 17:14:05.801343','solid_state_physics_v1');
