	 ('a7165100-3c07-4419-9575-b40c951a8a05'::uuid,'DESDOUT & RICOUR','GROUP','{"{\"название\": \"DESDOUT & RICOUR\", \"описание\": \"These individuals together measured pressure distributions in 1886 with bodies mounted on trains. Th\"}"}','"These individuals together measured pressure distributions in 1886 with bodies mounted on trains. Their contribution helps us understand the challenges and refinements needed in towing experiments for precise aerodynamic data collection."','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["573d5db6e587374521f111a47eaa08e2ce573235b08716d91bbe053504fe503530293339ede873a3ac356c3d376fcb97e005ef76112125385fa9e127d8e42fec", "573d5db6e587374521f111a47eaa08e2ce573235b08716d91bbe053504fe503530293339ede873a3ac356c3d376fcb97e005ef76112125385fa9e127d8e42fec"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('d1421c6d-fbc8-496f-8651-e08b243a8b98'::uuid,'CLOCKWORK POWERED WHIRLING ARMS','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"CLOCKWORK POWERED WHIRLING ARMS\", \"описание\": \"Clock-mechanism driven devices used in early aerodynamic tests, mentioned by Combes 1838, Casartelli\"}"}','Clock-mechanism driven devices used in early aerodynamic tests, mentioned by Combes 1838, Casartelli 1853, Dalglish & Wood 1853','{}','{}','{"frequency": 1, "text_unit_ids": ["16d966814983125a6e32b061e1707e94f1e8d9d91c7fb8fece809b8d03586b149afc62f017609bda9a3a36cbfcdfd60df5527110c12c82e5fcd08b8eb20847b0"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('a5c32ec5-8c00-4eb5-b14e-4c35ab63c833'::uuid,'NOVEL DYNAMOMETER FOR TESTING PROPELLER TORQUE AND POWER','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"NOVEL DYNAMOMETER FOR TESTING PROPELLER TORQUE AND POWER\", \"описание\": \"The NOVEL DYNAMOMETER FOR TESTING PROPELLER TORQUE AND POWER, a groundbreaking innovation developed \"}"}','The NOVEL DYNAMOMETER FOR TESTING PROPELLER TORQUE AND POWER, a groundbreaking innovation developed or utilized by Thurston, featured a unique and compact whirling arm apparatus. This device was designed to meticulously measure the performance of tested propellers without relying on pre-defined dimensions for its operations. The dynamometer''s novel design allowed for precise evaluation without imposing rigid size constraints, making it particularly versatile for various testing scenarios. Through this advanced tool, researchers or engineers could achieve more accurate assessments of propeller torque and power output, significantly enhancing the understanding and optimization processes in related fields such as marine engineering and propulsion technology.','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["aad64346832d005607e6f074e50b93db24a196be3569a7051b9ea3a264ebf7aa702d9cec5d822035b6a5525881e05e0b1fdb2129d2a732df097b8f62f283d6ab", "aad64346832d005607e6f074e50b93db24a196be3569a7051b9ea3a264ebf7aa702d9cec5d822035b6a5525881e05e0b1fdb2129d2a732df097b8f62f283d6ab"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('4a838bbe-5b0e-4750-8a16-59001a526a22'::uuid,'STEAM ENGINES','SYSTEM','{"{\"название\": \"STEAM ENGINES\", \"описание\": \"The advent of steam engines after 1820 provided a consistent and powerful power source necessary for\"}"}','The advent of steam engines after 1820 provided a consistent and powerful power source necessary for generating sufficient airflow in early wind tunnels','{}','{}','{"frequency": 2, "text_unit_ids": ["653aa46087e791b134dbbd802cc7f2be070fd13ba9b27acc8585793069a21cb0efa3b5f8653b3d05323cc3ed759a463b78204a2bc4749488e28d38de3050a9cc", "653aa46087e791b134dbbd802cc7f2be070fd13ba9b27acc8585793069a21cb0efa3b5f8653b3d05323cc3ed759a463b78204a2bc4749488e28d38de3050a9cc"]}','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','2026-07-17 13:19:24.183818','history_development_aeronautics'),
	 ('5ba5f9dd-06e4-46f6-9123-d22e9c509f0b'::uuid,'HIGH CONTRACTION RATIO AT THE ENTRANCE TO WORKING SECTION OF TUNNEL','DEVICE','{"{\"название\": \"HIGH CONTRACTION RATIO AT THE ENTRANCE TO WORKING SECTION OF TUNNEL\", \"описание\": \"The design feature known as the \\\"High Contraction Ratio at the Entrance to the Working Section of th\"}"}','The design feature known as the "High Contraction Ratio at the Entrance to the Working Section of the Tunnel" is a critical element in both early and modern wind tunnel setups. This feature is primarily aimed at minimizing local disturbances and turbulence near the model being tested, thereby ensuring a more uniform and high-quality airflow within the working section of the tunnel.
